ration of the top portion of an iPhone. The UI onscreen shows two images. On the left is a basket of mangoes, and on the right is a basket of artichokes. There are captions beneath the images that read 'Mangoes come from trees that belong to the genus Mangifera' and 'Artichokes come from a variety of a species of thistle.' The images and captions are all contained within a single VoiceOver frame.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/164a6323c5f3d7ec48c750a90eddd4ad/voiceover-incorrect-grouping%402x.png","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of the top portion of an iPhone. The UI onscreen shows two images. On the left is a basket of mangoes, and on the right is a basket of artichokes. There are captions beneath the images that read 'Mangoes come from trees that belong to the genus Mangifera' and 'Artichokes come from a variety of a species of thistle.' Just the image of mangoes and its caption are contained within a single VoiceOver frame.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/0965e3a106c0727f2b62404a1874f9e7/voiceover-correct-grouping%402x.png","line":41,"embedded":true},{"title":"A checkmark in a circle to indicate correct usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/88662da92338267bb64cd2275c84e484/checkmark%402x.png","line":45,"embedded":true},{"title":"`shouldGroupAccessibilityChildren`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ObjectiveC/NSObject-swift.class/shouldGroupAccessibilityChildren","line":47},{"title":"`AccessibilityNotification`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Accessibility/AccessibilityNotification","line":49},{"title":"`NSAccessibilityCustomRotor`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSAccessibilityCustomRotor","line"